    },
    {
      "text": "Liu tribe information Gu reports that Murong Gang defeated eight people in a row, but needs two hours to recover between battles, unlike Ye Lui Qun Xing who could fight consecutively. The same report says his defensive methods are strong while immortal essence expenditure is huge.",
